outs:
- hash: md5
  path: ng911
meta:
  computation:
    cmd: njdot roads fetch-ng911
    fetch:
      schedule: manual
    git_deps:
      /njdot/arcgis.py:
      /njdot/road_sources.py:
    note: |
      NJOGIS Road Centerlines of NJ (NG9-1-1), `Tran_road/FeatureServer`: `centerlines.parquet`
      (layer 0: local street names, route shields, county/muni, `SRI` tag, `x`/`y` vertex lists) and
      `aliases.parquet` (layer 1: name aliases by `RCL_NGUID`). Monthly upstream; source
      `editingInfo` dates in each parquet's key-value metadata. Attribution requested: "NJ Office of
      Information Technology, Office of GIS (NJOGIS)". Upstream fetch (`fetch:`, see
      `roadway_network.parquet.dvc`).
